'''Supernova 2026''' was a tournament held in Baltimore, Maryland on August 6-9, 2026.

This will be the first event to implement the "'''Steve Stage Clause'''" rule, where players or teams playing Steve will be unable to ban stages after winning a game, allowing their opponents to counterpick to any legal stage.<ref>[https://docs.google.com/document/d/1w6SDL0jvtRSkO9nNFmDIB__siuiLvZLuujorcXNS1D8/edit?tab=t.0#bookmark=id.6n09igmqxbkl Smash Ultimate ruleset at Supernova 2026]</ref>

